    title: "#952, the Gaussian moat: no walk to infinity through the Gaussian primes in steps of bounded length — OpenAI's proof, its Lean replayed here and its paper read by AI seats; Formal Conjectures' statement, marked solved but still sorry, proved in Lean from it",
